You can also engrave with better items.  If you use a wand of fire or
lightening, it is burned into the floor and hard (if impossible) to
wipe out.  A wand of digging engraves it permanent-like.  sharp
weapons engrave well and solidly, although they are dulled in the
process (with a couple exceptions)  True gems and gem rings also
engrave well.  

